{"id": "97110135", "name": "המרת מעלות לרדיאנים – זווית בין 0° ל-360°", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "none", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>לכמה רדיאנים שווה זווית של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:0}}^{\\circ}\\)</span>?</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\( {{CT:0}}^{\\circ}= \\) [[input:ans1]] \\( \\text{rad} \\)</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><p class=\"input-hint\" dir=\"rtl\" style=\"font-size:0.88em;color:#555;margin:6px 0 0;text-align:right\">איך מזינים: את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> מזינים <code dir=\"ltr\">pi</code>, וכפל עם כוכבית, למשל <code dir=\"ltr\">3*pi/4</code>.</p></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> משתמשים בקשר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(180^{\\circ}=\\pi\\ \\text{rad}\\)</span>, כלומר כופלים ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\frac{\\pi}{180^{\\circ}}\\)</span>.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — יחס ההמרה</b><br>בסיבוב שלם יש <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(360^{\\circ}\\)</span> ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(2\\pi\\)</span> רדיאנים, ולכן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(180^{\\circ}\\)</span> הם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> רדיאנים, ומעלה אחת היא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\frac{\\pi}{180}\\)</span> רדיאנים.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — ההמרה</b><br>כופלים ומצמצמים את השבר:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:0}}^{\\circ}={{CT:0}}\\cdot\\frac{\\pi}{180}=\\frac{ {{CT:0}}\\pi}{180}={{CT:1}} \\]</p>כלומר<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:0}}^{\\circ}={{CT:1}}\\ \\text{rad} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:Result]]", "prtcorrect": "<span class=\"correct\">תשובה נכונה, כל הכבוד.</span>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<span class=\"partially\">התשובה נכונה חלקית.</span>", "prtincorrect": "<span class=\"incorrect\">תשובה שגויה.</span>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "radians", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "Result-0-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "radians*2", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">בסיבוב שלם (<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(360^{\\circ}\\)</span>) יש <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:2}}\\)</span> רדיאנים, ולכן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(180^{\\circ}\\)</span> הם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> רדיאנים (ולא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(2\\pi\\)</span>).</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "Result-1-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "radians/2", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-2-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">בסיבוב שלם (<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(360^{\\circ}\\)</span>) יש <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:2}}\\)</span> רדיאנים, ולא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\pi\\)</span>.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 3, "answernote": "Result-2-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 3, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "degrees/180", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-3-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">חסר הגורם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\pi\\)</span>: <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(1^{\\circ}=\\frac{\\pi}{180}\\)</span> רדיאנים.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-3-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["degrees", "degrees_pi", "radians", "revolution_radians"], "nvariants": 33}